{
  "info": {
    "name": "CMS - Customer Billing Request",
    "_postman_id": "cms-customer-billing-v2",
    "description": "Customer Consignment Billing Request (CBR)\n\nFlow:\n1. ACMM pushes unpost sales → POST /api/acmm/unpost-sales/sync\n2. User computes CBR → POST /api/customer-billing/compute (creates HELD doc)\n3. User lists/views CBR → GET /api/customer-billing\n4. User releases CBR → PUT /api/customer-billing/:id/release (marks unpost as settled)\n5. User updates actual return qty → PUT /api/customer-billing/:id/detail/:detailId/actual-return-qty\n6. Reprocess: DELETE HELD doc → recompute\n\nDuplicate prevention: 400 if CBR already exists for same store+period.\nDoc No format: CBR-00001",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "billingId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "detailId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "ACMM Inbound",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sync Unpost Sales (POS / B2B / Online)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"lines\": [\n    {\n      \"store\": \"STORE01\",\n      \"sku\": \"ITEM001\",\n      \"salesQty\": 9.5,\n      \"salesReturnQty\": 0,\n      \"salesDate\": \"2026-04-05\",\n      \"sourceType\": \"POS\",\n      \"sourceRef\": \"POS-INV-0001\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"store\": \"STORE01\",\n      \"sku\": \"ITEM002\",\n      \"salesQty\": 10.0,\n      \"salesReturnQty\": 0,\n      \"salesDate\": \"2026-04-05\",\n      \"sourceType\": \"POS\",\n      \"sourceRef\": \"POS-INV-0001\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"store\": \"STORE02\",\n      \"sku\": \"ITEM001\",\n      \"salesQty\": 15.0,\n      \"salesReturnQty\": 1.0,\n      \"salesDate\": \"2026-04-06\",\n      \"sourceType\": \"B2B\",\n      \"sourceRef\": \"B2B-ORD-0001\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/acmm/unpost-sales/sync",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["consignment", "api", "acmm", "unpost-sales", "sync"]
            },
            "description": "Called by ACMM to push unpost sales/return data.\nsourceType: POS / B2B / ONLINE\nData goes into consignment_unpost table (is_settled = false).\nSeeder data already exists in V9 migration for testing."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{ \"lines\": [] }" },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/acmm/unpost-sales/sync",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["consignment", "api", "acmm", "unpost-sales", "sync"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Unpost sales synced\",\n  \"status\": 200,\n  \"data\": { \"synced\": 3 }\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer Billing Request (CBR)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Compute CBR",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.data && j.data.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('billingId', j.data.id);",
                  "  console.log('billingId:', j.data.id);",
                  "}",
                  "if (j.data && j.data.details && j.data.details.length > 0) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('detailId', j.data.details[0].id);",
                  "  console.log('detailId:', j.data.details[0].id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"store\": \"STORE01\",\n  \"fromDate\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"toDate\": \"2026-04-30\",\n  \"periodType\": \"MONTHLY\",\n  \"customerCode\": null,\n  \"createdBy\": \"admin\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/customer-billing/compute",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["consignment", "api", "customer-billing", "compute"]
            },
            "description": "Compute CBR from unsettled consignment_unpost for store+period.\n\nbillingQty = salesQty - returnQty per SKU.\nPrevents duplicate: 400 if CBR already exists for same store+period.\nTo reprocess: DELETE the HELD CBR first, then recompute.\n\nperiodType: MONTHLY / WEEKLY\ncustomerCode: null = all customers under this store"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"store\": \"STORE01\",\n  \"fromDate\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"toDate\": \"2026-04-30\",\n  \"periodType\": \"MONTHLY\",\n  \"customerCode\": null,\n  \"createdBy\": \"admin\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/customer-billing/compute",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["consignment", "api", "customer-billing", "compute"]
                }
              },
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Customer billing request computed\",\n  \"status\": 201,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"cbr-uuid-001\",\n    \"docNo\": \"CBR-00001\",\n    \"periodType\": \"MONTHLY\",\n    \"fromDate\": \"2026-04-01\",\n    \"toDate\": \"2026-04-30\",\n    \"store\": \"STORE01\",\n    \"customerCode\": null,\n    \"status\": \"HELD\",\n    \"processStatus\": \"COMPLETED\",\n    \"createdBy\": \"admin\",\n    \"releasedAt\": null,\n    \"details\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"detail-uuid-001\",\n        \"customerCode\": null,\n        \"itemCode\": \"ITEM001\",\n        \"uom\": \"PCS\",\n        \"salesQty\": 24.5,\n        \"returnQty\": 0.0,\n        \"billingQty\": 24.5,\n        \"unitPrice\": 15000000.0,\n        \"lineAmount\": 367500000.0,\n        \"actualReturnQty\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"detail-uuid-002\",\n        \"customerCode\": null,\n        \"itemCode\": \"ITEM002\",\n        \"uom\": \"PCS\",\n        \"salesQty\": 25.0,\n        \"returnQty\": 0.0,\n        \"billingQty\": 25.0,\n        \"unitPrice\": 10000000.0,\n        \"lineAmount\": 250000000.0,\n        \"actualReturnQty\": null\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Duplicate",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"store\": \"STORE01\",\n  \"fromDate\": \"2026-04-01\",\n  \"toDate\": \"2026-04-30\",\n  \"periodType\": \"MONTHLY\",\n  \"customerCode\": null,\n  \"createdBy\": \"admin\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/customer-billing/compute",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["consignment", "api", "customer-billing", "compute"]
                }
              },
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"A billing request already exists for store STORE01 period 2026-04-01 to 2026-04-30. Delete the existing HELD document before recomputing.\",\n  \"status\": 400\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. List CBR",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/customer-billing?page=1&perPage=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["consignment", "api", "customer-billing"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "perPage", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "docNo", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "store", "value": "", "description": "Internal supplier store", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "customerCode", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "customerBranch", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "periodType", "value": "", "description": "MONTHLY / WEEKLY", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "status", "value": "", "description": "HELD / RELEASED", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "processStatus", "value": "", "description": "COMPLETED / FAILED", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "fromDate", "value": "", "description": "YYYY-MM-DD", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "toDate", "value": "", "description": "YYYY-MM-DD", "disabled": true }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/customer-billing?page=1&perPage=20",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["consignment", "api", "customer-billing"],
                  "query": [{ "key": "page", "value": "1" }, { "key": "perPage", "value": "20" }]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"success\",\n  \"status\": 200,\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"cbr-uuid-001\",\n      \"docNo\": \"CBR-00001\",\n      \"periodType\": \"MONTHLY\",\n      \"fromDate\": \"2026-04-01\",\n      \"toDate\": \"2026-04-30\",\n      \"store\": \"STORE01\",\n      \"customerCode\": null,\n      \"status\": \"HELD\",\n      \"processStatus\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"createdBy\": \"admin\",\n      \"releasedAt\": null,\n      \"details\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"meta\": { \"page\": 1, \"perPage\": 20, \"totalData\": 1, \"totalPage\": 1 }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Get CBR by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/customer-billing/{{billingId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["consignment", "api", "customer-billing", "{{billingId}}"]
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/customer-billing/{{billingId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["consignment", "api", "customer-billing", "{{billingId}}"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"success\",\n  \"status\": 200,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"cbr-uuid-001\",\n    \"docNo\": \"CBR-00001\",\n    \"status\": \"HELD\",\n    \"details\": [\n      { \"id\": \"detail-uuid-001\", \"itemCode\": \"ITEM001\", \"salesQty\": 24.5, \"returnQty\": 0, \"billingQty\": 24.5 }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Release CBR (HELD → RELEASED)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/customer-billing/{{billingId}}/release",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["consignment", "api", "customer-billing", "{{billingId}}", "release"]
            },
            "description": "Release CBR.\nMarks all related consignment_unpost rows as settled (is_settled = true).\nAfter release: only actualReturnQty can be updated."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/customer-billing/{{billingId}}/release",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["consignment", "api", "customer-billing", "{{billingId}}", "release"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"success\",\n  \"status\": 200,\n  \"data\": { \"id\": \"cbr-uuid-001\", \"docNo\": \"CBR-00001\", \"status\": \"RELEASED\", \"releasedAt\": \"2026-04-13T06:00:00Z\" }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Not HELD",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/customer-billing/{{billingId}}/release",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["consignment", "api", "customer-billing", "{{billingId}}", "release"]
                }
              },
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Only HELD billing request can be released\",\n  \"status\": 400\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Update Actual Return Qty (RELEASED only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"actualReturnQty\": 1.5\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/customer-billing/{{billingId}}/detail/{{detailId}}/actual-return-qty",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["consignment", "api", "customer-billing", "{{billingId}}", "detail", "{{detailId}}", "actual-return-qty"],
              "variable": [
                { "key": "billingId", "value": "{{billingId}}" },
                { "key": "detailId", "value": "{{detailId}}", "description": "From details[].id in get response" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Update actual return qty on a detail line.\nOnly allowed when CBR status is RELEASED.\ndetailId = details[].id from get CBR response."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "PUT",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{ \"actualReturnQty\": 1.5 }" },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/customer-billing/{{billingId}}/detail/{{detailId}}/actual-return-qty",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["consignment", "api", "customer-billing", "{{billingId}}", "detail", "{{detailId}}", "actual-return-qty"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"success\",\n  \"status\": 200,\n  \"data\": { \"id\": \"cbr-uuid-001\", \"status\": \"RELEASED\", \"details\": [{ \"id\": \"detail-uuid-001\", \"billingQty\": 24.5, \"actualReturnQty\": 1.5 }] }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "6. Delete CBR (HELD only — for reprocess)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/customer-billing/{{billingId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["consignment", "api", "customer-billing", "{{billingId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Delete HELD CBR to allow recompute (reprocess).\nAfter delete, unpost rows remain unsettled — user can call /compute again for same period."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/customer-billing/{{billingId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["consignment", "api", "customer-billing", "{{billingId}}"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Customer billing request deleted\",\n  \"status\": 200\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Not HELD",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/consignment/api/customer-billing/{{billingId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["consignment", "api", "customer-billing", "{{billingId}}"]
                }
              },
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Only HELD billing request can be deleted\",\n  \"status\": 400\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
